{"code":0,"data":{"title":"快应用调起支付接口","content":"<h1 id=\"s-cm6c19sn\">一、接口声明</h1><pre><code>{ \"name\": \"service.pay\" }</code></pre><h1 id=\"s-sdrqfn7s\"><br>二、导入模块</h1><pre><code>import pay from '@service.pay' 或 const pay = require('@service.pay')</code></pre><h1 id=\"s-a54royyt\"><br>三、接口定义</h1><h2 id=\"s-tnhqg665\">1、pay.getProvider()<code>1000+</code></h2><p>获取服务提供商。</p><p><strong>参数：</strong></p><p>无</p><p><strong>返回值：</strong></p><p>字符串，服务提供商的代号，如厂商的英文品牌名称，假如无此服务则返回空字符串。</p><p><strong>示例：</strong></p><pre><code>console.log(pay.getProvider())</code></pre><h2 id=\"s-0x1ftfkh\">2、pay.payV2(OBJECT)<code>1105+</code></h2><p>服务端调用前置下单并支付接口后，使用V2接口完成指定支付渠道付款。</p><p><strong>参数：</strong></p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"103\" style=\"width: 103px\"><p><strong>参数名</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"102\" style=\"width: 102px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"67\" style=\"width: 67px\"><p><strong>必填</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"709\" style=\"width: 709px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"103\" style=\"width: 103px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>orderInfo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"102\" style=\"width: 102px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"67\" style=\"width: 67px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"709\" style=\"width: 709px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>订单信息。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"103\" style=\"width: 103px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>success</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"102\" style=\"width: 102px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Function</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"67\" style=\"width: 67px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"709\" style=\"width: 709px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>成功调起支付渠道app后回调此方法，并不代表订单支付成功，订单状态以服务端查询接口返回结果为准。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"103\" style=\"width: 103px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>fail</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"102\" style=\"width: 102px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Function</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"67\" style=\"width: 67px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"709\" style=\"width: 709px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付渠道app调起失败后回调此方法。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>orderInfo支持的key：</strong></p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\"><p><strong>参数名</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"67\" style=\"width: 67px\"><p><strong>必填</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>payInfo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"67\" style=\"width: 67px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>服务端下单并支付接口返回的订单内容。调用服务端接口后，需将返回结果中的data.payInfo原封不动的作为此参数的值，否则可能支付失败或受到风控。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>success/fail 返回值：</strong></p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\"><p><strong>参数名</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"108\" style=\"width: 108px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"773\" style=\"width: 773px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>code</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"108\" style=\"width: 108px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Integer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"773\" style=\"width: 773px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回状态码。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>message</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"108\" style=\"width: 108px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"773\" style=\"width: 773px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>消息内容，包含支付渠道的原始返回信息，具体含义见：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://pay.weixin.qq.com/wiki/doc/apiv3_partner/apis/chapter7_2_7.shtml\">微信app支付返回码说明</a> ，<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://opendocs.alipay.com/open/204/105302?pathHash=eab39489#resultStatus%20%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E7%A0%81%E5%90%AB%E4%B9%89\">支付宝app支付同步通知说明</a>。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>code 说明：</strong></p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\"><p><strong>状态码</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"299\" style=\"width: 299px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>0</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"299\" style=\"width: 299px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付成功</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>100</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"299\" style=\"width: 299px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>取消支付</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>200</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"299\" style=\"width: 299px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>201</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"299\" style=\"width: 299px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付渠道（微信、支付宝）app未安装</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>202</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"299\" style=\"width: 299px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请求过频</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>203</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"299\" style=\"width: 299px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口参数异常</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>204</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"299\" style=\"width: 299px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付信息异常</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>205</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"299\" style=\"width: 299px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>调用支付能力失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"104\" style=\"width: 104px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>300</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"299\" style=\"width: 299px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>其他错误</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>示例：</strong></p><pre><code>// 1.请求服务端下单接口\nfetch.fetch({\n  url: 'your order url',\n  method: 'POST',\n  data: requestData,\n  responseType: 'json',\n  success: function (ret) {\n    // 服务端下单接口返回的支付信息\n    this.payInfo = ret.data.payInfo \n  }\n})\n// 2.发起支付\npay.payV2({\n  orderInfo: { payInfo: this.payInfo },\n  success: function (data) {\n    console.log(`成功调起支付渠道, code = ${data.code}, message = ${data.message}`)\n  },\n  fail: function (data) {\n    console.log(`调起支付渠道失败, code = ${data.code}, message = ${data.message}`)\n  },\n})</code></pre>","versionCode":1,"updateTime":1739178125000,"breadCrumbs":"快应用管理,快应用支付平台接入,前置下单模式,快应用调起支付接口","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}